flowchart TD
  IDEA["idea or plan section"] --> S4["S4 materialize. Target: crate-atom-gate --report --json then plan-materialize. Today: hand files in docs/plan/dag/"]
  S4 --> LINT{"bead-lint: crate: and arrow: labels?"}
  LINT -->|no| RLINT["REFUSE. Do not file"]
  LINT -->|yes| OPEN["br create. status Open. class label: impl or grade or research"]

  OPEN --> SEL["S5a select. MUST be bv --robot-triage plus loop-queue-filter. MUST NOT be br ready FIFO"]
  SEL --> CLASS{"work class this tick?"}
  CLASS -->|grade starving| GRADE["pick IssueStatus::Grading first. Post-mortem M2"]
  CLASS -->|research starving| RES["pick label research-needed"]
  CLASS -->|impl articulation| IMPL["bv PageRank articulation point. Not easy leaf"]
  GRADE --> CLAIM
  RES --> CLAIM
  IMPL --> CLAIM

  CLAIM["attempt claim. bead-availability Availability::Available"] --> CLQ{"claim?"}
  CLQ -->|ClaimFenceError any arm| NEXT["retain blocker chain. next rank. dispatcher-deadman watches eligible with no packet"]
  NEXT --> SEL
  CLQ -->|ok in_progress assigned| FENCE["S5b dispatch-claim-fence authorize_bead_dispatch_as"]
  FENCE --> PERMIT{"DispatchPermit?"}
  PERMIT -->|ClaimRequired or AssignedElsewhere or PacketAddsScope| REF["REFUSED. bead stays claimable"]
  REF --> SEL
  PERMIT -->|Bead| SEND["ntm --robot-send via subprocess-contract and Cx. TransportKind::NtmRobotSend"]

  SEND --> ACK["ack-stage. ACK token on pane_id comment"]
  ACK --> DEC{"receiver decision?"}
  DEC -->|Accepted| WIP["S6b work. omp-rpc-session GetState plus tick-monitor two-capture"]
  DEC -->|Denied reason| DENY["status Open. label research-needed. class=research. original blocks on new research bead. finding crate files the gap"]
  DENY --> SEL
  ACK -->|no ACK| INDET["Indeterminate. not delivery. not progress"]
  INDET --> SEL

  WIP --> DONE{"implementer claims done?"}
  DONE -->|yes| GRADEQ["status Grading. MUST be a different agent"]
  GRADEQ --> SEL
  DONE -->|no| WIP

  GRADE --> CLOSE{"verify-dispatch bead status only. ClosePrefix?"}
  CLOSE -->|MutationVerified or Done or Approved or WontFix| CLOSED["closed. LifecycleEvent written. orchestrator sees who when why"]
  CLOSE -->|PolicyRefused or Empty or Unread| BACK["stays Grading. not closed"]
  BACK --> SEL

  LEDGER["every transition appends LifecycleEvent: bead, class, actor, pane, reason_code, why-now. Human reads omp-orchestrator portal one_next_action. Agent reads --json"]
  CLAIM --> LEDGER
  SEND --> LEDGER
  DEC --> LEDGER
  CLOSE --> LEDGER
